Your system should never look at only one timeframe.

For example:

1D    → Macro trend
4H    → Structure
1H    → Direction
15M   → Setup
5M    → Entry
1M    → Execution

The exact mapping should be configurable by strategy.

The system could produce:

NIFTY

1D  → Bullish
4H  → Bullish
1H  → Bullish
15M → Pullback
5M  → Liquidity sweep
1M  → Bullish displacement

Result:
LONG setup
